## Delivery and fallback policy

- No custom glyph subset, outline edit, conversion, or family rename was performed. These are the
  publishers' complete WOFF2 files, so the OFL reserved-name conditions and upstream language
  coverage remain intact.
- Alegreya Medium and Plex Sans Condensed SemiBold are preloaded because the first frame uses them
  for the location/action voice and uppercase tactical metadata. The remaining weights load only
  when the stylesheet requests them.
- `font-display: swap` preserves immediate readable text. Metric-adjusted local Georgia and Arial
  Narrow faces are transient fallbacks only; `size-adjust`, ascent, descent, and line-gap overrides
  reduce reflow if a bundled font is delayed or corrupt.
- `font-synthesis: none` prevents browser-invented bold or italic forms. The shipped static weights
  are the only production faces.
